shortdesc Add coffee stains to documents
longdesc This package provides an essential feature that LaTeX has been
longdesc missing for too long: It adds coffee stains to your documents.
longdesc A lot of time can be saved by printing stains directly on the
longdesc page rather than adding them manually.
